  "_non_evm_note": "Solana (SVM) and Sui (Move) are not EVM and have no Etherscan-style verified-source API. The fields below differ from EVM entries: no chain_id/explorer_api/explorer_key_env. Source acquisition and PoC tooling are chain-specific — see the referenced playbook file. Phase 0 maps chain_class → metrics_file + playbook_file.",
